post.description:
Re-pull one backend's model catalog (the settings "sync" button).

For Claude Code this scrapes its ``/model`` TUI live and caches the result;
for Codex it re-reads the CLI-maintained cache.

get.description:
Conversation history. Pass ``session_key`` for an exact key, or
``session_id`` for a web session (mapped through ``web_session_key``);
with neither, all non-archived sessions are merged.
